Step 05 is done and recorded: typed `approve` now lists matches for an inexact name instead of failing with "Known IDs". `tsc` is clean and `npm test` passes (727 pass, 0 fail). Nothing was run against a live harness session.

The code is in commit `9aca3b9`, and `plan.step-done` added the handoff commit `4a649dc`.

- **Exact ID:** approves as before, with no model turn.
- **Inexact name:** approves nothing and lists up to ten matches grouped by specification, plan and decision. Matching is case-insensitive on words in IDs and titles. Several arguments are joined into one name, so `preset creation` finds `feature/preset-creation`.
